    <h1>The Rebuild Sprint. <em>Two weeks, custom-coded, hand-off.</em></h1>
    <p>For service-business owners who want a real custom-coded site, do not want to commit to a recurring plan, and do not want a $5,000 deposit-and-maintenance-retainer agency relationship. Two weeks, $4,500 flat, you own the result.</p>
